{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/unlimitedbiking/items/394572/", "pk": 394572, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/unlimitedbiking/", "pk": 5980, "shortname": "unlimitedbiking", "name": "Unlimited Biking", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Santa Monica & Venice Beach eBike Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 5, "unicode": "Santa Monica & Venice Beach eBike Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": -3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 271000, "description": "Enjoy the best of Los Angeles with this two hour guided eBike tour that begins in Santa Monica near the famous Santa Monica Pier! You must be at least 16 to ride our pedal assist ebikes. There will be guests riding standard, non-electric bikes on this tour. Take in the ocean breezes, visit the historic Venice Canals, ride through Marina del Rey, take pictures with the Art Walls, and explore Muscle Beach. You’ll be able to visit all of the main highlights that the area has to offer, while learning fun facts, seeing beautiful views, and more! \n\nThis guided tour takes about 3 hours, including various stops near essential attractions while our guides provide in-depth narration and stop for photo opportunities at famous sights and hidden gems throughout the tour. For safety reasons, we are unable to attach tag-a-longs and trailers to ebikes.\n\nGuests must be 16+ to ride an eBike!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "1431 Ocean Ave Santa Monica, CA 90401", "booking_notes": "PICK UP LOCATION : Please look closely at the location that you picked in the booking.\n\n1431 Ocean Ave\nSanta Monica, CA 90401\n\nPlease plan to arrive 15 minutes early as the tour does leave on time. Let our team know if you are running late. \n\nOur Store Hours are:\nNovember-March: 9AM - 5PM\nApril - October: 9AM - 7PM\n\nPlease bring along a valid form of identification and a credit card with you, as these will be needed for security upon check-in for your rentals. Your outfit should be seasonally suitable; we also suggest that you dress in something comfy, not too loose, and closed-toe shoes. Don't forget a proper ID and your camera!\n\n**Know Before You Go:**\n\n- We do not allow child attachments on bike tours for safety reasons.\n-Riders must be at least 16 years old to ride eBikes\n- Any riders under 18 years of age must have an adult present to check in and sign the waiver form on their behalf. We require a valid identity card upon check in.\n- For all our riders' safety, we are not able to accommodate any riders who are 300 pounds and over as this exceeds the weight limit the manufacturer has advised for the bike's build. We apologize for the inconvenience, but we do prioritize your safety during the ride. \n\nIf anything from the list above concerns you or any members of your party, please feel free to reach out to our team by responding to this email. We will get back to you as soon as we can!\n\nFor any questions, please feel free to reach our team at 212-749-4444. We'll see you soon!", "cancellation_notes": "**Bike Tour Cancellation Policy**\n\nPlease notify us at sales@unlimitedbiking.com at least 24 hours in advance if you can